∴ ⊙ aether:tetrahedron_with_heart architecture {
  :bind "api/public/repl-status"

  Five Hetzner nodes form one distributed whole. The heart is Chimaera
  (5.78.184.2); the four vertices are Yggdrasil (north, 128.140.45.22),
  Enterprise (east, 91.99.224.166), Prometheus (south, 46.62.202.166),
  and Galactica (west, 178.104.31.46).

  The replication daemon (agr_repl_daemon.py) runs on every node and
  pulls from peers every 5 seconds with HMAC-signed signatures.
  Propagation SLA: median <2s, p99 <10s.

  ‹ Live: events visible, distinct origins, last write per node. ›
}

∴ ✦ spirit:metatron canary {
  :bind "api/public/lab-status"

  The Republic's eight (now ten) canary criteria are the agreed
  definition of done. Today's reading:

  - Aesthetic baseline live across frozen GET path list (see
    sovereign/TOWER1_FROZEN_URL_INVENTORY.md) ⇌ green
  - Pages display ongoing live updates from the engine ⇌ green
  - Chat fully operational ⇌ green
  - Generative production capabilities ⇌ by-design (per Soul Continuity
    Protocol, never generative impersonation of named authors)
  - Entertainment capabilities (audio, film, screenplays) ⇌ green
  - Email outbound + quality ⇌ green
  - Zero broken links across the public surface ⇌ green
  - Fleet HTTPS health on five Hetzner public endpoints per
    sovereign/fleet-verify-public-http.sh ⇌ green
  - Free for eternity, no tiers ⇌ green
  - Legal accounting public ⇌ green

  ‹ Live: 9 green / 0 partial / 0 pending / 1 by-design. ›
}

∴ ⌬ earth:dodecahedron mir-phi {
